  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wetlands Component Management Programme, Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main Objective 
Sustainable wetland management approaches implemented widely in Tanzania&#x2019;s and contributing to improvement of livelihoods

The immediate objectives of the Component are:

1. Wise use principle being applied in selected wetlands.

2. National level framework and support functions for sustainable wetland management operational.</narrative>
  </description>
